    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28371" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρέπᾰνον</span></b> , τό, also
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δράπανον</span></b>  (q. v.), (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρέπω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρεπάνη, δ. εὐκαμπές</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				18.368
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλκέοις ἤμα δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					534
				</span></i>
			; the usual form in Prose and Com., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.125
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. θεριστικόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMagd.</u>
					8.6
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>pruning-knife,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				333d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>scythe,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				6.1.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>curved sword, scimitar,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.112
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.93
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				576
			</span></i>.</div>
